      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "PRESENT PARTICIPLES (ongoing action):",
          "Form: infinitive + 'd' + adjective ending",
          "",
          "der laufende Mann (the running man)",
          "die kommende Woche (the coming week)",
          "",
          "EXTENDED PRESENT PARTICIPLES:",
          "der schnell laufende Mann",
          "(the fast-running man)",
          "",
          "die nächste Woche stattfindende Prüfung",
          "(the exam taking place next week)",
          "",
          "COMPLEX EXAMPLES:",
          "der vor drei Jahren veröffentlichte Bericht",
          "(the report published three years ago)",
          "",
          "Common in news and formal writing, not speech."
