    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "We learned Action Passive in Lesson 36.",
          "A second type, State Passive, shows a CONDITION:",
          "",
          "ACTION: Das Fenster wird geöffnet.",
          "(The window is being opened - action)",
          "STATE: Das Fenster ist geöffnet.",
          "(The window is open - state/result)",
          "",
          "COMMON STATE PASSIVES:",
          "ist geöffnet (is open)",
          "ist geschlossen (is closed)",
          "ist verheiratet (is married)",
          "ist geschieden (is divorced)",
          "ist verlobt (is engaged)",
          "ist vorbereitet (is prepared)",
          "",
          "Mein ehemaliger Kollege ist verheiratet.",
          "(My former colleague is married - a state)"
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Lektion 51"
      }
    ]
  },
